     * @see [Slowly fly to a location](https://maplibre.org/maplibre-gl-js/docs/examples/flyto-options/)
     * @see [Fly to a location based on scroll position](https://maplibre.org/maplibre-gl-js/docs/examples/scroll-fly-to/)
