 * @example
 * ```ts
 * let map = new Map()
 *     .addControl(new GlobeControl());
 * ```
 * 
 * @see [Display a globe with a fill extrusion layer](https://maplibre.org/maplibre-gl-js/docs/examples/globe-fill-extrusion/)
